  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country research idea LAND-at-scale Colombia: Intercultural Agreements and Constructive Transformation of Socio-environmental and Territorial Conflicts: Keys to Making Them Possible</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research aims to identify and analyse the factors that facilitate positive conflict transformation and the development of intercultural neighborhood agreements in contexts where there are disputes over land tenure and the use and conservation of the environment (water sources, biodiversity, ecological connectivity, hunting, fishing, timber).</narrative>
  </description>
